<DocsLayout slug="network">
  <section aria-labelledby="summary">
    <h2 id="summary">Every connection</h2>
    <p>OpenOrc has no server of its own. Every connection goes straight from your computer to one of the services below. This table lists each one, when it happens, and how to stop it. Cloud threads add connections from a sandbox or the cloud brain on your own account, described under <a href="#cloud">Cloud threads and the brain</a>.</p>
